<TXSPN>It was the work of a single instant.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s head vanished, as though carried off by a strong wind.<PG>
At the same moment something like blood was smeared thickly over me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Something like blood, or rather, real blood?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Did that person from before do it?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Impossible... they were a good 100 meters away. There is no way they could have got close in that one instant.
